{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"歷代志上","commonName":"歷代志上","title":"歷代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"a668b4b6547e2ee24f3b6e74327236fef85ba56c9634c2dd8acf5b518e6a27b8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":939},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大衛攻取拉巴城"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["過了一年，到列王出戰的時候，約押率領軍兵毀壞亞捫人的地，圍攻拉巴；大衛仍住在耶路撒冷。約押攻打拉巴，將城傾覆。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["大衛奪了亞捫人之王所戴的金冠冕",{"noteId":18},"，其上的金子重一他連得，又嵌着寶石；人將這冠冕戴在大衛頭上。大衛從城裏奪了許多財物，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["將城裏的人拉出來，放在鋸下，或鐵耙下，或鐵斧下",{"noteId":19},"，大衛待亞捫各城的居民都是如此。其後大衛和眾軍都回耶路撒冷去了。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["與非利士巨人爭戰"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["後來，以色列人在基色與非利士人打仗。戶沙人西比該殺了偉人的一個兒子細派，非利士人就被制伏了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["又與非利士人打仗。睚珥的兒子伊勒哈難殺了迦特人歌利亞的兄弟拉哈米；這人的槍桿粗如織布的機軸。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["又在迦特打仗。那裏有一個身量高大的人，手腳都是六指，共有二十四個指頭，他也是偉人的兒子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["這人向以色列人罵陣，大衛的哥哥示米亞的兒子約拿單就殺了他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["這三個人是迦特偉人的兒子，都死在大衛和他僕人的手下。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":18,"caller":"-","text":"王：或譯瑪勒堪。瑪勒堪即米勒公，是亞捫族之神名","reference":{"chapter":20,"verse":2}},{"noteId":19,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：強他們用鋸，或用打糧食的鐵器，或用鐵斧做工","reference":{"chapter":20,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}